WEBVTT

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:18.400
That was a close one.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.080
But good job, Itsuki!

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:21.870
Now offer the Star Ward!

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:25.120
We've finally reached the quarter-way mark.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:26.260
Ahem.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:30.340
Our next foes lie deeper in the labyrinth.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:31.500
Does that mean...

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.390
The deeper you go, the more concentrated 
and evil the Impurities become.

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:36.840
That's not good...

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:41.310
Visitor-sama!

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:42.860
Again?

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:44.670
What an unsettling roar.

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:46.940
You still haven't figured 
out what's causing it?

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:48.460
Sorry.

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:50.350
But no matter what they are,

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:54.410
you have no chance of winning unless you 
increase the number of Star Children!

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:57.880
I know that, but we've been 
fighting all this time

00:00:57.880 --> 00:00:59.820
and I haven't had the time to see them.

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:02.750
I'm well aware.

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:04.870
That's why I have prepared a special event,

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:08.380
which will close the distance 
between you and the maidens!

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:09.960
That's not possible.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:11.450
A summer fling!

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:14.140
If you're on a resort vacation, 
you can do it any time, any place!

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:15.420
Anything goes, just do it!

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:19.360
Attention, passengers.

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:22.310
It's my treat today.

00:01:22.310 --> 00:01:24.180
Enjoy to your heart's content!

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:27.190
Yes!

00:01:27.190 --> 00:01:28.680
Yay!

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:30.190
Oh, Mana.

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:33.040
I never realized you were
  such a good person.

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:36.860
Of course not!
 This is all for the Love Rituals!

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:38.760
I bet you're so happy now!

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:43.100
Twelve half-naked maidens will 
be cheerfully playing with you!

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:43.830
Huh?

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:45.740
You imbecile!

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:46.910
You still don't get it?

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:48.620
It's for a summer fling!

00:01:48.620 --> 00:01:51.690
In Sola, you're obviously going 
to the beach for a summer fling!

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:57.010
Get a taste of the raunchy sense of 
freedom under the sun with the maidens!

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:32.590
Mana even prepared swimsuits for all of us!

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:34.780
Really? That's great.

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:36.900
Hey, cute babes!

00:03:37.620 --> 00:03:38.900
Oh, it's you, Lillith!

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:40.590
What a coincidence.

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:44.030
I'm heading to the beach, 
too, for a photo shoot.

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:46.280
Are that guy's clothes torn up?

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:48.320
He's creepy.

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:49.800
He looks weak.

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:51.660
I can beat him in one blow!

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:52.990
Who's that?

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:54.190
You don't know?

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:55.840
He's Seiya, the idol of the academy.

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:57.740
A stud who's popular with girls!

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:00.420
He's so persistent!

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:04.750
Seiya approaches us maidens 
one after another.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.640
I wonder if he's a stalker 
obsessed with maidens.

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:11.640
Yeah, he used to drink at the bar
 where I work every single night.

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:13.450
He was following me around before that,

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:15.880
and his target now is Lillith.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:17.000
Really?

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.930
He's not a bad person, though...

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:21.150
Why do you say that?

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:22.900
It's like this.

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.880
He's a playboy by birth.

00:04:25.880 --> 00:04:30.570
His personality makes him want to pursue 
maidens who would never fall for him.

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:33.910
We can only wait until he gives up.

00:04:34.220 --> 00:04:37.420
But how did he find out 
we're going to the beach?

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:38.910
What's the matter?

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:41.420
N-Nothing.

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:45.800
Sorry, everyone!

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.690
There you go!

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:18.060
Itsuki, how do you like the 
swimsuits I prepared?

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:20.970
They're so revealing that you 
can't resist them, can you?

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:28.010
I can tell how excited you are 
by looking at your pocky stick!

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:28.010
Why, you... Mine is super thick!

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:34.770
We came all the way to the beach. 
Aren't you going to swim?

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:38.280
My fortune today said to avoid water...

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:40.280
Can I sit beside you?

00:05:40.280 --> 00:05:41.850
You can't!

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:44.580
Please go see everyone else.

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:44.440
Raise your head!

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:46.240
Swing your arms!

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.770
Run faster!

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:51.080
His photo shoot was selfies?

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:54.300
He's a genuine narcissist.

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:56.440
You don't have to defend his behavior.

00:05:56.440 --> 00:06:00.320
No, it's all from my fortune-telling

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:03.400
Um... What would you like to know?

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:06.520
My fated partner, who's waiting for me.

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:08.780
Huh? Uh...

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:11.600
I already know that the 
maidens have to be virgins.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:15.500
But that just means they 
have to remain pure, right?

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:20.150
Even if they have important duties, 
they should be free to fall in love.

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:23.950
He's the biggest narcissist 
and playboy in this world,

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:26.920
so no one can stop him.

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:29.630
What? How can that be?

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:34.430
Are you saying that my 
fortune-telling is a sham?!

00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:36.730
No, that's not what I meant...

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:39.770
You're so mean!

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:40.870
No way! I'm sorry!

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:45.000
Hey, you bastard!

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.840
What the hell did you do to Lillith?

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:48.510
Who are you?

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:49.470
I'm Lillie!

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:53.160
My chest hurts, and I'm tearing up!

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:54.820
What the heck did you do?!

00:06:54.820 --> 00:06:58.430
I was just saying maybe she shouldn't 
believe too much in fortune-telling...

00:06:58.430 --> 00:06:59.560
That's unforgivable!

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:00.780
Are you mocking her?

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:02.830
Come on, it's just fortune-telling.

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:03.930
Just fortune-telling?

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:05.070
Are you crazy?

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:07.800
Lillith's fortune-telling is absolute!

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:10.320
It's never been wrong before!

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:12.070
That's not possible.

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:17.950
Then tell me when, where, and at what 
exact time did she get it wrong?

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:20.220
Huh? Cat got your tongue?

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:21.210
Listen...

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:26.710
Sorry, but I don't believe 
in fortune-telling and stuff.

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:27.920
You fool!

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:31.260
Say that after you see it for yourself!

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.830
You nitwit!

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:38.040
Lillith, tell this stupid Visitor's fortune,
 and show him who's the boss!

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:38.970
Ready?

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:42.640
Th-That hurts.

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:43.480
Are you all right?

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:46.270
Was Lillie-chan angry?

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:49.360
Yeah, she told me to decide whether 
or not to believe in fortune-telling

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:52.030
after you tell my fortune.

00:07:52.600 --> 00:07:55.440
I would like to ask you to try as well.

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:58.720
Then you should understand...

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:00.060
All right.

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:02.300
If that satisfies the two of you.

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:06.040
Okay, please allow me.

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:14.300
Huh?

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:16.430
Lillith? What's wrong?

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:18.640
I-I'm sorry!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:19.680
What did you see?

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:24.810
Well, uh... um...

00:08:26.760 --> 00:08:31.990
Actually, my fortune-telling 
is a sham. That's fine.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:34.460
I'm sorry.

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:36.970
I can't possibly...

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:45.480
Hey, what are those two arguing about?

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:47.920
Who knows? I have no idea.

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:50.230
I'll reward you well for this.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:52.260
Grin!

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:54.720
Did you put Lillith in a tight spot again?

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:56.400
That wasn't my intention...

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:58.810
I just had her read my 
fortune, as you instructed.

00:08:58.810 --> 00:09:00.640
So what was it?

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:02.500
The result of her fortune-telling!

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:07.000
Don't tell me you believed her?!

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:08.020
But...

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:09.340
Whisper, whisper.

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:10.880
A lover's quarrel?

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:12.280
That's cute.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:13.780
So you'll give me what you promised?

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:15.780
Yes. Well done.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:16.910
Yay!

00:09:20.680 --> 00:09:21.520
What is it?

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:22.910
Shut up! Keep quiet!

00:09:24.050 --> 00:09:25.770
So that's what happened.

00:09:25.770 --> 00:09:29.130
Hey, Visitor. Are you ready?

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:30.670
Ready for what?

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:32.680
You're so dumb!

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:35.420
I'll tell you what Lillith couldn't tell you.

00:09:35.870 --> 00:09:38.050
You'll die at this rate!

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.010
Where did that come from?

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:41.560
She saw the seal of death on you.

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:44.040
It'll happen in the near future, too.

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:44.990
I see.

00:09:44.990 --> 00:09:47.600
Hey, are you okay with that?

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:49.450
You still don't believe it?

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:52.430
There's nothing I can do if 
that's my fortune, right?

00:09:52.430 --> 00:09:54.810
I mean, how am I supposed 
to react to that, anyway?

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:58.070
Then hurry and drop dead, you moron!

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:01.450
We gave you a proper warning, got it?

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:03.180
That's cruel...

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:05.450
That's my line!

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:07.620
Damn! I'm so frustrated!

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:11.710
That hurts...

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:14.270
How am I supposed to believe that?

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:16.280
Um... did she...

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:18.090
Yes, Lillie told me everything.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:21.980
I'm sorry, but I still can't believe it.

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:24.350
But it's the truth...

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:27.950
Then when, where, and how am I going to die?

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:29.560
Your fortune-telling is absolute, right?

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:30.650
Then tell me.

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.730
Please don't say it like that.

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:35.930
A maiden's duty is to assist the Visitor.

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:38.810
Fortune-telling can predict the future,

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:41.710
but it can also be used to avoid danger.

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:46.820
But you'll have to believe 
my fortune-telling first.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:50.170
Please look over there!

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:55.260
I told you that it wasn't 
possible to stop him earlier,

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:58.970
but I can change his behavior using 
the results of my fortune-telling

00:10:58.970 --> 00:10:59.950
You mean...

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:03.260
I can't let something happen 
to the maidens, so...

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:06.350
I sent his mortal weakness 
over there, just in case.

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:09.520
Madam Tokugawa-sensei's technique

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:12.700
that will make anyone climax 
with just the tip of a finger!

00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:15.610
This is Mana's Touch!

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:21.110
Finishing blow: Mana's Touch!

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:27.990
The fun has just begun!

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:32.250
If you touch there...

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.040
But it feels so good...

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.140
Don't stop!

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:40.300
I made a helpless thing climax again.

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:45.660
I'm sure Seiya-san won't be 
bothering anyone for quite some time.

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:48.040
You really managed to change fate...

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:52.860
Itsuki-san, do you still not 
believe my fortune-telling?

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:56.750
I'm sorry about before. 
I'll believe you and Lillie.

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:58.570
No, I'm starting to want to believe you.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:11:59.450
Then...

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:01.190
Yes, please.

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:07.880
Are you all right?

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:10.030
Uh... um...

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:14.080
I'll leave the rest to Lillie-chan!

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:16.960
Wait a second...

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:19.040
This is all too sudden!

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:20.590
What happened?

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:24.840
Apparently, your life will be spared 
if we make a Star Child now.

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:26.940
Is that right?

00:12:26.940 --> 00:12:28.180
But are you sure about this?

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.520
Lillith's fortune-telling is absolute.

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:34.020
And... you believe in us, right?

00:12:35.010 --> 00:12:40.230
Yes. Then you'll have my child?

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:43.360
I've got no choice.

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:43.360
I'll do my best.

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:54.500
I can't hold on any longer! I give up!

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:57.130
If any one of you falls, you all get punished!

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.040
This is too cruel!

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:00.750
She's a demon.

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:04.970
You over there! Focus harder 
if you have the energy to chat!

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:08.310
Are you all training hard?

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.760
Visitor-sama!

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:14.360
Itsuki! Oh, you!

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:16.990
You could've told me you were coming!

00:13:16.990 --> 00:13:17.980
Stare...

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:22.150
Um...

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:23.610
If you'd like...

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:25.230
I knew you might come,

00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:28.940
so I ordered some from 
"The Cafe with Great Red Tea!"

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:30.780
Okay, then...

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:33.290
It's great!

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.770
If you've never experienced this 
great taste and aroma before,

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:37.540
<b>Hello, Good-Bye</b>

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:37.540
<b>"Check the official website for details!"</b>

00:13:35.770 --> 00:13:37.100
check our website!

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.780
I'm glad you liked it!

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:40.540
Huh?

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:45.170
Damn, he's after Arie next?

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:48.640
Hey, Seiya! Enough is enough!

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:50.390
He's so hot!

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.890
Darn, he found me.

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:56.040
Are you all right, Arie?

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:59.160
I-I'm not Arie!

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:00.670
You've mistaken me for someone else!

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:01.370
What?

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:03.650
Wait, Seiya!

00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:10.320
How did he know it was me?

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:12.250
I put on a disguise!

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:12.910
Welcome.

00:14:13.430 --> 00:14:15.640
Is the item I ordered finished?

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:17.410
Yes. Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:20.490
It sure was a lot of work!

00:14:20.490 --> 00:14:22.540
The beauty of the steel!

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:25.770
Its dark reflection reminds me of a jewel!

00:14:25.770 --> 00:14:30.750
There's only one blacksmith remaining in 
Granvania who can polish steel like that.

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:32.680
But why did you want such 
an old-fashioned weapon?

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:37.050
We maidens cannot fight,

00:14:37.050 --> 00:14:40.750
so I at least want to be close 
to Itsuki-san in spirit,

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:42.740
with this naginata by my side.

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:47.610
If only I could find a wife 
who was like you, Arie!

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:49.880
Oh, you don't really mean that.

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:54.370
Oh, no! The kids will 
return to the church soon.

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:11.380
Welcome, my cute Naginata-chan.

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:24.040
Lord, thank you for protecting 
Itsuki-san again today.

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:27.150
Who is it?

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:30.150
Can I hide here?

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:35.080
The Lord says to love your enemies

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:39.200
and pray for those who persecute you.

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:40.660
That's a relief.

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.870
Is something troubling you?

00:15:45.800 --> 00:15:49.090
I can hear you out, if you don't mind.

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:51.600
I see.

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:55.080
Love is patient, love is kind.

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:58.970
I hope the love within you 
comes to fruition one day.

00:15:58.970 --> 00:16:00.800
Thank you!

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:03.480
It was so painful not being 
able to tell anyone!

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:05.420
It's all right.

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:09.390
But now that you've shared a secret with me,

00:16:09.390 --> 00:16:13.740
I'll also have to share my secret with you.

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:21.750
Yes, please swing harder!

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:24.000
Like this?

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:27.380
No, harder!

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:30.320
Okay, then how about this?

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:32.000
Are you kidding?

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:34.130
Stop playing around
 and use a proper stance!

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:39.130
U-Um... Actually, this is really heavy.

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:40.160
You're so mean!

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:43.640
You're making Naginata-chan cry!

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:48.820
No! Help me!

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:50.570
Arie! Are you okay?

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:53.190
Seiya, you...

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:54.570
You scum!

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:57.050
No, no! It's not like that, Itsuki!

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:58.080
Shut up! Not another word!

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:00.940
There's a deep explanation to this! 
Deeper than the sea...

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:02.640
Shut up! No excuses!

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:06.160
Sea! I was showing her what to do 
when someone is drowning in the sea!

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:03.910
I'm so relieved.

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:06.090
Itsuki-san, wait!

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:07.250
S-See?

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:10.270
We're just playing around...

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:14.090
Arie, don't worry. I'll never let 
another soul know about this.

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:17.550
Even if you've lost your 
status as a maiden...

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:21.070
Don't worry, Itsuki!

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:25.160
She's still giving off the 
aroma of a fresh virgin!

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:30.010
In fact, she's still an innocent maiden 
who hasn't even kissed anyone before!

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:32.730
What exactly is going on, Arie?

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:37.360
What on earth is this?

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:41.040
It is creepy, isn't it?

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:44.080
It's fine. I knew you would react this way.

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:45.370
Awesome!

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:47.870
I'm surprised you were 
able to collect so many!

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:53.460
Uh, you have to point it down in a stance.

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:55.260
Hurry!

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:57.220
Like this?

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:59.260
Yes! Wonderful!

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:04.040
That pose makes the long spear 
glitter more than anything else!

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:07.360
Look! The aura at the spike 
is the proof that it's happy!

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:08.770
You really are the chosen Visitor!

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:11.040
R-Really?

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:11.770
Seiya-san!

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:14.900
Don't just stand there! Take a photo! 
We may never get a chance again!

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:16.780
Yeah, leave it to me!

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:18.350
What's your problem?

00:18:18.350 --> 00:18:19.910
Itsuki-san, try this next.

00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:23.260
It's my personal opinion,

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:27.470
but I think a bow is most erotic when 
 the bowstring is stretched to its limit!

00:18:27.470 --> 00:18:29.950
The tension it releases is out of this world!

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:31.020
Right...

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:32.420
So...

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:37.840
That's it!

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:40.090
You really are something else!

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:43.360
I'm not strong enough to pull that hard!

00:18:43.360 --> 00:18:45.690
Did you hear that?

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:48.600
She's smiling in elation!

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:51.740
Uh, Arie... are we done?

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:53.310
Wait! Just a little more!

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:54.120
Seriously?

00:18:54.120 --> 00:18:56.520
Good, Itsuki! Give me more!

00:18:56.520 --> 00:19:01.200
Weapons really shine to their fullest 
when they're in the hands of

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:02.740
a truly great Visitor!

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:07.680
Don't worry, I know how you all feel.

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:12.140
You all want to be embraced 
by Itsuki, don't you?

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:16.090
But I'm sorry, can I be next?

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:18.720
Oh, Arie! You perv!

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:22.060
Oh, no! What am I thinking?

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:24.680
Um... Was that thing earlier...

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:27.640
Yes. I asked Seiya-san,

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:30.570
but he couldn't handle her at all.

00:19:30.570 --> 00:19:32.240
Uh, what's that?

00:19:32.240 --> 00:19:35.150
It's obviously the ceremonial 
weapon for weddings, a naginata.

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:37.650
When the time comes, I want 
her by my side for our...

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:41.200
Hey, I think you've got it all wrong.

00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:45.620
Unfortunately, the real 
naginatas are like this.

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:46.730
No way!

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:49.250
There's also the Firearms
 and Swords Control Act...

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:53.080
You'd be arrested on sight for carrying 
something so dangerous in Sola!

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:54.060
What?

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:55.750
N-No way...

00:19:56.470 --> 00:20:00.130
Then... I've done everything in vain?

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:03.180
But I'm a bit relieved.

00:20:03.810 --> 00:20:08.620
Actually, I thought it was hard to 
approach you, since you were so serious.

00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:09.740
Really?

00:20:09.740 --> 00:20:14.120
But I wasn't expecting a hobby like this
 or a frivolous side of you.

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:15.280
I'm relieved.

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:17.740
Does that mean you...

00:20:17.740 --> 00:20:20.220
Yes, I'm starting to like you a lot,
 including the fact

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:21.510
that you're a weapon enthusiast.

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:23.360
Itsuki-san!

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:25.040
Don't cry.

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:27.080
But I'm so happy!

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:28.940
Then, can we...

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:33.830
Arie, will you have my child?

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:35.500
Of course!

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:42.260
It really makes you nervous 
when it's the real thing...

00:20:42.260 --> 00:20:44.220
I'll wait for you inside.

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:46.800
Come in when you're mentally prepared.

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:47.930
Okay.

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:54.840
Perhaps Itsuki-san knew about 
my secret the whole time.

00:20:57.250 --> 00:20:59.320
What?!

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:10.950
<b>I've Got So Many Kids</b>

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:45.510
Thank you for waiting, Seiya-san.

00:22:45.870 --> 00:22:46.860
Hi.

00:22:46.860 --> 00:22:49.760
Did the Love Ritual go well after that?

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:51.530
Yes.

00:22:51.530 --> 00:22:53.120
I'm so jealous.

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:57.280
But I got great photos thanks 
to you, so we're even.

00:22:57.280 --> 00:22:58.260
Here you go.

00:23:00.020 --> 00:23:01.530
That's so wonderful!

00:23:01.530 --> 00:23:03.020
What about those?

00:23:03.020 --> 00:23:04.830
They're from the trip. Wanna see?

00:23:04.830 --> 00:23:05.780
Of course!

00:23:06.290 --> 00:23:07.550
Aren't they great?

00:23:07.550 --> 00:23:08.250
Yes.

00:23:08.250 --> 00:23:10.200
Amazing poses!

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:15.330
Maybe I'll make an exception 
and let you see the best photo!

00:23:16.800 --> 00:23:19.210
So cute!

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:29.970
Seiya is actually after Itsuki?!

00:23:32.550 --> 00:23:39.980
Will You Have My Child BlehBleh!

00:23:37.760 --> 00:23:39.240
Hoodlum.
